`,e.jsx(r.p,{children:"Reviewed October 20, 2026. All 88 game cases have a real-game preview with explicit provenance: 44 GameMap captures from linked browser builds, 5 local source-project captures, and 39 creator-published gameplay screenshots or recording stills. The page badges distinguish these origins. Creator images have a source-review date, not an invented capture date. These are game pixels, not generated illustrations or reconstructed promotional artwork. Optional engine foundations are excluded."}),`
