`,e.jsxs(r.p,{children:["The local ",e.jsx(r.a,{href:"/GameMap/assets/media/showcase/streamrender-car-mobile.mp4",children:"mobile MP4"})," is 2.05 MB (2,047,833 bytes), with a matching ",e.jsx(r.a,{href:"/GameMap/assets/media/showcase/streamrender-car-mobile.webp",children:"first-frame WebP poster"}),". The manifest records its parent case, source asset, layout, dimensions, timing, sizes, and SHA-256 checksums separately in the top-level ",e.jsx(r.strong,{children:"variants"})," array. It is an alternate presentation of one existing case, so the homepage still has ",e.jsx(r.strong,{children:"six primary cases"}),"."]}),`
