`,e.jsxs(r.p,{children:["The Holodeck living-room preview remains available beside its resource entry, separately from the six homepage cases. It is an author-published camera tour of a generated room layout, objects, and materials; it is not character gameplay or a complete playable game. Its original provenance and title are preserved in the manifest's top-level ",e.jsx(r.strong,{children:"libraryClips"})," array. The former arcade homepage clip is no longer part of the curated media set."]}),`





















