`,e.jsxs(r.p,{children:["Each excerpt and its matching poster is in ",e.jsx(r.code,{children:"website/public/assets/media/showcase/"}),". The ",e.jsx(r.a,{href:"/GameMap/assets/media/showcase/manifest.json",children:"manifest"})," records original URLs, source and output dimensions, excerpt boundaries, sizes, and SHA-256 checksums. The six primary excerpt videos total 21.13 MB; the mobile alternative adds 2.05 MB and the preserved Holodeck library clip adds 3.98 MB. All bundled MP4s total ",e.jsx(r.strong,{children:"27.16 MB"})," (27,156,189 bytes). Including all matching posters, the complete local demo media bundle totals ",e.jsx(r.strong,{children:"27.62 MB"}),". The videos are H.264 MP4s with no audio track and with the ",e.jsx(r.code,{children:"moov"})," box before ",e.jsx(r.code,{children:"mdat"})," for progressive playback."]}),`
`,e.jsx(r.p,{children:"Only the selected hero case attaches a video source on entry. Previews are muted; manual pause persists across cases and tracks. Reduced-motion and data-saving preferences start with the genuine first-frame poster. Playback pauses offscreen, in hidden tabs, during a detail drawer or navigation overlay, and while another preview or film player is active. Gallery videos attach only on pointer intent or an explicit click. Unoptimized legacy remote videos are click-to-play only. Seek position and time are derived from the playing media rather than a decorative progress animation."}),`
`,e.jsx(r.p,{children:"Watch full demo opens an accessible player with native controls, sound where present, and the original author-hosted recording. Those full films and external project pages require internet access. The 2D secondary source uses the official author repository's raw download URL to avoid a slow GitHub Pages node; the project page remains the attribution source."}),`
`,e.jsx(r.h2,{id:"attribution",children:"Attribution"}),`
`,e.jsx(r.p,{children:"Recordings, rendered scenes, and underlying characters/artwork remain the property of their respective authors and rights holders. These are linked, credited research-directory excerpts. Project code licenses do not automatically grant rights to all video, game characters, paper figures, or generated outputs. The OpenGame and OpenDCAI/3AGameFactory repositories, Holodeck author page, SolarRenderer author page, and NVIDIA project page are retained beside the cases."}),`
`,e.jsx(r.p,{children:"Legacy research posters for MarioGPT, Hunyuan3D, TRELLIS, Infinigen, and GameNGen remain in the resource library. They keep their existing author links and descriptions. GameNGen's poster is explicitly a method figure. TRELLIS's author-published material is identified for academic/research purposes. These images are not substituted for the six homepage videos."}),`
`,e.jsx(r.h2,{id:"homepage-showreel",children:"Homepage showreel"}),`
`,e.jsxs(r.p,{children:["The ",e.jsx(r.a,{href:"/GameMap/assets/media/promo/gamemap-showreel.mp4",children:"GameMap showreel"})," combines three eight-second excerpts with GameMap title bookends and cross-dissolves into an approximately 24.4-second silent H.264 loop. Native HTML synchronizes chapter captions and case/source links with playback. The separate ",e.jsx(r.a,{href:"/GameMap/assets/media/promo/manifest.json",children:"promo manifest"})," records the final encoding, exact timing, file sizes, and SHA-256 checksums."]}),`

























