`,e.jsx(r.p,{children:"The gallery now groups 29 presentations under 28 distinct original recordings. The six curated excerpts used by the learning paths remain the same. This expansion adds 17 original recordings: six game demonstrations, two asset animations, six world/scene demonstrations and three scene/development workflows. Public creator pages and repository media were checked rather than treating static screenshots as moving footage. The nine new remote videos decoded and advanced in installed Chrome; the eight new local previews decoded and sought successfully. This validates playback, not model reproduction or game completion."}),`
`,e.jsx(r.p,{children:"Game cards name the runtime confirmed by their linked project, and link back to the corresponding game case where available. Asset generators are not assigned an invented game engine. Category labels distinguish gameplay, asset generation, scene generation, world models and development workflows. New GIF-derived previews preserve the source animation timing; the original recording link opens the author GIF. Expanded notes on each card explain excerpt scope, historical versions and access requirements."}),`



































































































































